      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Artes Marciais. Mienfoo domina as lutas com sequências contínuas e fluidas de golpes, cortando inimigos com garras afiadas. Eles se isolam nas montanhas para treinar, e cada grupo possui estilos diferentes de chutes e golpes de mão.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo, Humanoide &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Mienfoo pode evoluir para Mienshao no nível 15 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Pound</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Meditate</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Detect</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Fake Out, Fury Swipes</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Double Slap</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Swift</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Calm Mind</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Force Palm</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Drain Punch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Jump Kick</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Hone Claws, U-turn</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Bounce, High Jump Kick, Quick Guard</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Reversal</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>17</td><td>Aura Sphere</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acrobatics, Aerial Ace, Agility, Ally Switch, Attract, Aura Sphere, Baton Pass, Bounce, Brick Break, Bulk Up, Calm Mind, Close Combat, Coaching, Confide, Dig, Double Team, Drain Punch, Dual Chop, Endure, Facade, Fling, Focus Blast, Focus Punch, Frustration, Grass Knot, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Knock Off, Low Kick, Low Sweep, Mega Kick, Mega Punch, Payback, Poison Jab, Protect, Psych Up, Rain Dance, Reflect, Rest, Retaliate, Return, Revenge, Reversal, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Role Play, Round, Sleep Talk, Snore, Stone Edge, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Swords Dance, Take Down, Taunt, Tera Blast, Toxic, Trailblaze, U- turn, Upper Hand, Work Up</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Ally Switch, Baton Pass, Endure, Feint, Focus Punch, Knock Off, Low Kick, Me First, Smelling Salts, Vital Throw</p>",
